#
# File:         sdkconfig.defaults.ws43b
# Module:       Build / ESP-IDF defaults, Waveshare ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-4.3B layer
#
# Purpose:      What the Waveshare ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-4.3B build changes from
#               sdkconfig.defaults and sdkconfig.defaults.esp32s3.
#               platformio.ini names this file for the board's environments
#               through SDKCONFIG_DEFAULTS (board_build.cmake_extra_args).
#               IDF 5.3.1 still reads "<file>.<target>" after each file it is
#               given (tools/cmake/kconfig.cmake), so the order is
#               sdkconfig.defaults, sdkconfig.defaults.esp32s3, then this
#               file, and a later value wins.
#
#               The part: ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8, 8 MB octal PSRAM and native
#               USB only, which is the S3 layer's own; everything that layer
#               says stands. This one adds only what the RGB panel needs.
#               Sources in src/board.h, BBS_BOARD_WS_S3TOUCH43B.
#
#               PlatformIO keeps the generated sdkconfig.<env>, a value it
#               already holds wins over this file, and it does not watch this
#               file: delete sdkconfig.ws_s3touch43b* after editing here, and
#               check the generated file. A value outside its Kconfig range is
#               discarded, not clamped.
#
# Targets:      ESP32-S3 (ESP-IDF 5.3.1)
# See also:     sdkconfig.defaults.esp32s3, platformio.ini, src/board.h
#
